        "@value": "Supply Bill 2009"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/16/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/16/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Supply Act 2009. Issue and appropriation for the service of the year 2009"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/16/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/16/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The issue of a sum not exceeding one hundred and twenty- nine billion nine hundred and sixty-one million three hundred and eighty-two thousand and three hundred ringgit (RM129,961,382,300) from the Consolidated Fund for the service of the year 2009 is hereby authorised, and that sum is appropriated for purposes specified in the Schedule. 2 Bill"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/16/eng@/~sched_1",
      "@type": "akn:schedule",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/16/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Purpose Title B. 1 Parliament B. 2 Office of the Keeper of the Rulers’ Seal B. 3 Audit Department B. 4 Election Commission B. 5 Public Services Commission B. 6 Prime Minister's Department B. 7 Public Services Department B. 8 Attorney General's Chambers B. 9 Anti-Corruption Agency B. 10 Treasury B. 11 Treasury General Services B. 12 Contribution to Statutory Funds B. 13 Ministry of Foreign Affairs B. 20 Ministry of Plantation Industries and Commodities B. 21 Ministry of Agriculture and Agro-based Industry B. 22 Ministry of Rural and Regional Development B. 23 Ministry of Natural Resources and Environment B. 24 Ministry of International Trade and Industry B. 25 Ministry of Domestic Trade and Consumer Affairs B. 26 Ministry of Entrepreneurial and Co-operative Development B. 27 Ministry of Works B. 28 Ministry of Transport B. 29 Ministry of Energy, Water and Communications B. 30 Ministry of Science, Technology and Innovations Supply Purpose Title B. 31 Ministry of Tourism B. 32 Ministry of the Federal Territories B. 40 Education Service Commission B. 41 Ministry of Education B. 42 Ministry of Health B. 43 Ministry of Housing and Local Government B. 44 Ministry of Unity, Culture, Arts and Heritage B. 45 Ministry of Youth and Sports B. 46 Ministry of Human Resources B. 47 Ministry of Information B. 48 Ministry of Women, Family and Community Development B. 49 Ministry of Higher Education B. 60 Ministry of Defence B. 62 Ministry of Home Affairs TOTAL"
      }
